### Colección para la extensión REST Client de VS Code (humao.rest-client)
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1

### Login (copie access_token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@marea.cl", "password": "Marea2026!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.access_token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prácticas de octubre
GET {{base}}/practices?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Morosos (cargos vencidos)
GET {{base}}/finance/delinquents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Quiénes no han pagado este mes
GET {{base}}/finance/delinquents?period=2026-10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumen financiero
GET {{base}}/finance/summary?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
